    {
      "text": "Jude has grown up among the faerie nobility since being taken from the human world as a child. She wants a place at court despite the contempt directed at mortals, especially by Prince Cardan. Proving herself draws her into political schemes where belonging and safety are not the same thing. As rivalries threaten her sisters, Jude must decide how far she is willing to go to gain influence in a society that was never meant to welcome her.",
      "work_id": 928101361,
      "evidence": [
