    {
      "text": "Scarlett's chance to visit Caraval arrives just as an arranged marriage seems to close off the life she wants. She escapes her island with her sister Tella to attend a performance in which the audience participates. Once there, Scarlett discovers that Tella's disappearance has become the central challenge. Finding her means entering a contest whose appearances cannot be trusted. The promise that it is only a game offers little comfort when her sister's future seems to depend on winning.",
      "work_id": 928101379,
